      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Discover Subscription Packages Experience the magic of live symphonic music with the PEI Symphony Orchestra’s Discover Subscription Packages at the Sobey Family Theatre. PEISO Discover 4-Concert Series For only $240.20 (all taxes and fees included), enjoy all four (4) PEISO 2026–27 concerts: Belonging – October 18, 2026 Revolution – November 15, 2026 Resurface – March 7, 2027 Edge – April 11, 2027 *Offer does not apply to student and/or youth tickets. New purchases only. HOW TO GET THIS OFFER: Add 4 tickets to your cart, one for each show listed above, and the discount will be automatically applied to your cart. Or you can visit us at the box office or give us a call toll-free: 1-800-565-0278. PEISO Discover Three Pack Can’t make all four? Choose any three (3) of the ticketed PEISO 2026–27 concerts: Pick from: Belonging – October 18, 2026 Revolution – November 15, 2026 Resurface – March 7, 2027 Edge – April 11, 2027 For only $180.15 (all taxes and fees included)* *Offer does not apply to student and/or youth tickets. New purchases only. HOW TO GET THIS OFFER: Add 3 tickets to your cart, one for 3 of the 4 shows listed above, and the discount [&hellip;]"
      }
