    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Viking River Cruise Raffle"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Set sail on an unforgettable journey.  You could win an 8-day European voyage with Viking River Cruises, valued at over $17,000 CAD, in partnership with CAA. Between now and 7:30 p.m. AST on Saturday, September 26, raffle tickets can be purchased online at our website or at the Confederation Centre Box Office: $100 per ticket or three for $250. A winner will be drawn at random on September 26 after the closing performance of Come From Away We&#8217;re only selling 1000 raffle tickets, so get yours now! All raffle proceeds go to supporting arts programming at Confederation Centre of the Arts One winner and a guest will get to choose from six incredible 2026/2027 European Viking River Cruises voyages: Rhine Getaway Romantic Danube Danube Waltz Paris and The Heart of Normandy Lyon &amp; Provence Chateaux, Rivers, and Wine Why Your Support Matters Every ticket purchased helps support Confederation Centre of the Arts and its mission to bring world-class theatre, music, and cultural experiences to Prince Edward Island. From the Charlottetown Festival to community programming and youth education, your support helps keep the arts thriving in our region. Tickets purchased from outside Prince Edward Island are not valid. Important: Please read the Viking [&hellip;]"
      }
    ],
