      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Outback Presents Barking Ventures Warning: This performance may include strong language and mature content. In her debut show Gone Rogue, Kyla covers everything from the chaos of Barcelona dating life to navigating a friend crush and the power plays of a barbeque. Kyla brings fearless honesty, quickfire wit, and a knack for spinning real-life chaos into killer stories. With a loyal fanbase, explosive stage presence, and growing international demand, Kyla Cobbler is not just a rising star — she’s a force to be reckoned with.  "
      }
