        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Tracy and Martina Live! - Confederation Centre of the Arts"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "All the way from Cape Breton Island, the girls head out on their first cross-Canada tour. Come see the viral East Coast duo as they bring their signature storytelling and off the cuff humour to the stage. If you’re missing home or just want a good laugh, Tracy and Martina deliver every time. With stories, crowd interaction, and plenty of surprise moments, it’s a night you won’t forget!"
      }
    ],
