        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "article"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#title": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Sandman - Confederation Centre of the Arts"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "TIME WARP PROMOTIONS PRESENTS The only Metallica-sanctioned tribute band Sandman, the only Metallica-sanctioned tribute band, has been blowing audiences away since 1994. Band members Rick Van Dyk (lead vocals and lead/rhythm guitar), Joe Di Taranto (lead/rhythm guitar and vocals), Paulo Fonseca (bass and vocals), and Brent Niemi (drums) collectively bring a lifetime of musical experience playing and recording. After a curious series of events in early 2016, the members of Metallica gave SANDMAN their blessing to pay tribute to their music — resulting in a momentous meeting at Toronto’s famed Opera House in November 2016. They’ve played sold-out shows in Dubai recently and have just come off Metallica’s World M72 tour through the U.S. and Canada."
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#url": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "https://confederationcentre.com/event/sandman/"
      }
    ],
