    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "FOR THE CENTRE:\r\nDebut. THEATRE: Bright Star (Mirvish/GTP, Dora nomination); Waitress (Capitol); Life After (Mirvish/Yonge St); Titaníque(Mirvish/Segal); Kiss Me, Kate (Drayton); The Importance of Being Earnest, Controlled Damage, The Invisible (Grand); Beautiful: The Carole King Musical(1st/2nd US National Tours, Arts Club &amp; Stage West, Betty Mitchell winner); Radio City Christmas Spectacular (New York); Jesus Christ Superstar, Camelot (Stratford); Cabaret, Trifles, The Light in the Piazza (Shaw); Jesus Christ Superstar (Broadway), Niagara Symphony Orchestra. FILM/TV: Star Trek: Strange New Worlds, Workin’ Moms, Reign, Christmas Movie Magic, Mayday, America’s Got Talent, The View, The Tony Awards, Assassin’s Creed: Valhalla. IG: kaylee.harwood WEB: kayleeharwood.com"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://confederationcentre.com/genid/214207505bdda2a2",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Person"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://confederationcentre.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Nathanael-Judah-Headshot-2026_.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Nathanael Judah"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "FOR THE CENTRE:\r\nDebut\r\nTHEATRE:\r\nHansel and Gretel Panto (Port Hope); A Strange Loop (Soulpepper, Musical Stage Co., Crow&rsquo;s); Charlie and the Chocolate Factory (Grand Theatre); Gem of the Ocean, The Doctor&rsquo;s Dilemma, The Amen Corner, Gypsy, Antigonick, Just to Get Married (Shaw Festival); A Few Good Men (Drayton); Hairspray (Theatre Aquarius)\r\nFILM/TV:\r\nKim&rsquo;s Convenience (CBC); Spin (Disney Plus, Family); The Parker Andersons (BYU)\r\nOTHER:\r\nDora Award (A Strange Loop); Toronto Theatre Critics Award (A Strange Loop)\r\n\r\n&ldquo;I relate to Bob in so many ways and am looking forward to tackling this show with this group of people. Thank you for supporting live theatre.&rdquo;\r\n\r\nIG:\r\n\r\n@NathanaelJudah"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://confederationcentre.com/genid/9965da8849270504",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Person"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://confederationcentre.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Beatrice-Kwan-Headshot-2026_.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Beatrice Kwan"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "FOR THE CENTRE: Debut.\r\n\r\nTHEATRE: Bring It On: The Musical (The Globe Theatre); Die Harsh (Grindstone Theatre); Samca (Spindle Collective/Riot King); Diamond Tooth Gerties (Dawson City, YT); The 4th R (Fringe Tour); Worldly Women (Fringe Tour).\r\n\r\n&ldquo;Huge thanks to all the wonderful people in my life who continuously support my unconventional endeavours. Having grown up reading and watching Anne, it&rsquo;s a true honour to get to be a part of this Canadian legacy. I&rsquo;m ecstatic to bring this story to life alongside this wonderful cast and crew.&rdquo;\r\n\r\nIG: @beakwan"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://confederationcentre.com/genid/7521f86c4ff868f2",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Person"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://confederationcentre.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/HaKeenaManeso-1.jpg"
