    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Ha’Keena Maneso"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "FOR THE CENTRE: Anne of Green Gables—The Musical™, Jersey Boys.\r\n\r\nTHEATRE: Bring It On! (Globe Theatre); Shrek The Musical, Beautiful: A Carole King Musical (Drayton Entertainment); Into The Woods (Ovation Theatre); Groundhog Day The Musical (YES Theatre); Pollyanna, A Christmas Story (Theatre Aquarius); Joseph and The Amazing Technicolour Dreamcoat (Tweed and Company); 9 to 5 (Stephenville Theatre Festival); Rocky Horror Picture Show, Pippin, Apothecary, Cats (St. Lawrence College).\r\n\r\nTRAINING: Musical Theatre (St. Lawrence College).\r\n\r\nHa’Keena is a dancer, singer and actor originally from Moose Jaw, Saskatchewan. She is thrilled to be returning to Anne of Green Gables—The Musical™ for her second year! Ha’Keena wants to thank her Kindred Spirits back home, her friends and family, for their love and support; she would not be here without you!"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://confederationcentre.com/genid/2059bfbc429ed7ed",
