    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "FOR THE CENTRE:\r\nAnne of Green Gables—The Musical™, Tell Tale Harbour, Jersey Boys, Evangeline, Canada Rocks\r\nTHEATRE:\r\nHMS Pinafore, Guys and Dolls (Stratford Festival); Once—The Musical, Mamma Mia!, Tommy, Crazy for You, Miss Saigon, Les Misérables (Mirvish Productions)\r\nFILM/TV (SELECT):\r\nSpotlight, Murdoch Mysteries, The Handmaid’s Tale, Designated Survivor, Guillermo Del Toro’s Cabinet of Curiosities, Reacher, Dan for Mayor, Supernatural, Outer Limits, The X-Files, MacGyver\r\n\r\n“Always happy and grateful to be back on the world’s most beautiful isle!”"
