    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "FOR THE CENTRE:\r\n4th Season. Anne of Green Gables&mdash;The Musical&trade;, Jersey Boys, I&rsquo;m Every Woman, Maggie, Tell Tale Harbour (2022)\r\nTHEATRE:\r\nMusic Director: After the Rain (Tarragon/Musical Stage Co, National Arts Centre); A Christmas Carol (Shaw Festival 2022 &amp; 2025); Alice in Wonderland (Bad Hats/Soulpepper &ndash; Dora nomination). Associate Music Director: Natasha, Pierre &amp; the Great Comet of 1812 and Octet (Crow&rsquo;s/Musical Stage Co). Assistant Conductor/Key 1: Disney&rsquo;s The Lion King (Mirvish)\r\nTRAINING:\r\nBachelor of Music (Mount Allison University), Shaw Festival music internship\r\n\r\nRachel is a Toronto-based music director and pianist originally from Truro, Nova Scotia."
      }
