    "http://ogp.me/ns#title": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Girls Night Out The Show® - Confederation Centre of the Arts"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Ages 19+ only – photo ID required. Any ticket holder unable to present valid identification indicating that they are at least 19 years of age will not be admitted to this event, and will NOT be eligible for a refund. Contains adult content (no frontal nudity) Contains strobe and fog effects Direct from Las Vegas! Girls Night Out The Show®—the ultimate Ladies Night Out—is taking over the stage live at the Confederation Centre of the Arts on October 9 at 7:30 PM! This high-energy, all-male dance revue will have you on the edge of your seat from start to finish with heart-pumping music, chiseled bodies, seductive routines, cheeky humor, and boy-next-door charm. This isn’t the kind of show where you just sit and watch! Girls Night Out The Show® is a fully interactive, immersive experience thundering with excitement. Get ready to get a little wild in an empowering, fun-filled atmosphere and embark on an unforgettable night with your friends. Tickets sell fast—don’t wait! Get yours today! Facebook Instagram Website"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#url": [
