    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Ghost Tour"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Step into the shadows of Charlottetown’s past on our eerie Ghost Tour at the Confederation Centre of the Arts. Beginning each evening, this guided walking tour winds through the heart of downtown, tracing dark alleys and venerable streets as your guide — a mysterious gravedigger‐character — conjures up chilling stories of hauntings, unexplained sounds, and long-buried secrets. Built for lovers of history and thrill alike, the tour blends rich heritage with ghostly intrigue: from colonial architecture to old legends lurking behind every corner. You’ll hear whispered tales of restless spirits, historical tragedies and sightings that linger in the night air. Whether you’re a tourist seeking a unique adventure or a local wanting to see your city in a new light, this Ghost Tour delivers an immersive experience like no other. Bring your bravest friends, wrap up warm, and get ready to explore Charlottetown’s haunted heartbeat. Wear comfortable shoes and dress for the evening outdoors."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/keywords": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Guided Walking Tour, Heritage Tours"
      }
    ],
