    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Come From Away"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Running Time: 1h 40 (No Intermission) Come From Away is based on the true story of a small town that welcomed the world. What started as an average day in Gander, Newfoundland turned into a historic moment when 38 planes carrying thousands of people were diverted there on September 11, 2001. Cultures clashed and nerves ran high, but the East Coast community welcomed these &#8220;come from aways&#8221; into their lives with open arms; uneasiness turned into trust, and gratitude grew into enduring friendships. Come From Away tells a heartwarming story of kindness in the face of unprecedented circumstances. AUDIENCE ADVISORY: Light haze effects are used in this production. Contains occasional coarse language. POST-SHOW TALK-BACKS Every Thursday this summer, starting July 16, ticket holders are invited to join company members for a post-show Come From Away Conversation following the performance. Simply stay in your seat, as they begin approx. 10 minutes following the show, and last about 15-20 minutes. Aug  20, 27 Sept 3, 10, 17, 24 Venue: Sobey Family Theatre Charlottetown Festival · Summer 2026 📅 2026 Festival Schedule ●Anne of Green Gables – The Musical™ ●Come From Away ●C&#8217;mon In! An Island Kitchen Party ●Polka Dot Door Complete calendar [&hellip;]"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/keywords": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "On Stage, Theatre"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventStatus": [
      {
        "@id": "http://schema.org/EventScheduled"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventAttendanceMode": [
      {
        "@id": "http://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode"
      }
    ]
  },
