    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": " Performance on August 21 will be at 12 pm  Peep through the Polka Dot Door with us this summer at the Confederation Centre Amphitheatre! Polka Dot Door is a FREE outdoor family musical inspired by one of Canada&#8217;s most beloved children&#8217;s shows. Join Polkaroo and friends for a joyful adventure filled with sing-along songs, playful storytelling, and plenty of laughs along the way. Perfect for young audiences and the young-at-heart, this fun and educational show brings the magic of the classic series to life in a lively outdoor performance the whole family can enjoy together. Performances run Monday–Saturday. &nbsp; August 2026 Thursday, August 20 Friday, August 21 Saturday, August 22 — Closing &nbsp; In association with TVO Media Education Group Charlottetown Festival · Summer 2026 📅 2026 Festival Schedule ●Anne of Green Gables – The Musical™ ●Come From Away ●C&#8217;mon In! An Island Kitchen Party ●Polka Dot Door Complete calendar of performances at the Sobey Family Theatre, The Mack, and Outdoor Amphitheatre. View Full Calendar → &nbsp; &#8220;The participation of these Artists are arranged by permission of Canadian Actors Equity Association under the provisions of the Dance•Opera•Theatre Policy.&#8221;"
      }
